Live DV is a mobile phone application based on WIFI's Sports Camera, a new way to connect sports cameras. With Live DV, you can connect a sports camera for video preview, playback, picture and video downloads.
The main function:
1, When you connect a sports camera with Live DV, you can live view in real time.
2, Support through Live DV on the motion camera to record video preview playback;
3, Support photos and videos taken with Live DV to manage and view sports cameras;
4, Support various options for manipulating the camera through the app control.
